colonne : elements 300 inputs {x objects} pass column body {{compiled double}} blocks 300 why {}
tuple : pass single body {{compiled double} {compiled double}} blocks 600 elementwise 0 expr 0 why {}
-in direct : inputs {x {cells double(64) stride 16} y {cells double(64) stride 16}} pass single write direct why {}
fonction : pass per-component body {{compiled double} {expr: not compiled near "foo($y))"}} blocks 300 elementwise 0 expr 300 why {single pass: component 1: expr: not compiled near "foo($y))"}
fixe texte : pass column body {{expr: variable "k" is not a number}} blocks 0 elementwise 0 expr 1 why {error: cannot use non-numeric string "abc" as right operand of "*"}
un texte : pass column body {{compiled double int}} blocks 255 elementwise 0 expr 1 why {element 3: x = "abc" is not a number, by expr}
un entier : pass per-component body {{compiled double int} {compiled double}} blocks 600 elementwise 0 expr 0 why {single pass: element 3 is not a double in every input}
-sum : pass reduce body {{compiled double int}} blocks 300 elementwise 0 expr 0 why {}
recouvrement : pass single write {columns into cells} why {direct write: target: overlapping columns}
-in objets : pass column write {columns into objects} why {direct write: target: not a typed list in cells of double(64), without traces}
sans chemin : pass column write {set (the whole variable)} why {direct write: the whole variable (no path)}
résultat gardé : 2.0 4.0
erreur gardée : {cannot use non-numeric string "abc" as left operand of "*"} {element 1: x = "abc" is not a number, by expr}
option seule : ERR wrong # args: should be "type map -report varName ?-in target|-sum|-min|-max|-fold {name init}? varList list ?varList list ...? {(expression)}"
