@ ::h line 1 : blocks 300 body {{compiled double int}} calls 1 command lmap elements 300 elementwise 0 expr 0 {pass column} 1
@ ::m line 1 : blocks 0 body {{expr: not compiled near "$::k)"}} calls 1 command {type map} elements 0 elementwise 0 expr 1 {pass column} 1 why {error: cannot use non-numeric string "abc" as right operand of "+"}
@ ::n line 1 : blocks 299 body {{compiled double int}} calls 1 command foreach elements 300 elementwise 1 expr 0 {pass fold} 1
